      IPMI_Version_Change_Hardware_Incompatibility_Detected_With_Associated_Entity
  - IPMI_Version_Change_Firmware_Or_Software_Incompatability_Detected_With_Associated_Entity ->
      IPMI_Version_Change_Firmware_Or_Software_Incompatibility_Detected_With_Associated_Entity
o In freeipmi_interpret_sensor.conf fix field name typos:
  - IPMI_Version_Change_Hardware_Incompatability_Detected_With_Associated_Entity ->
      IPMI_Version_Change_Hardware_Incompatibility_Detected_With_Associated_Entity
  - IPMI_Version_Change_Firmware_Or_Software_Incompatability_Detected_With_Associated_Entity ->
      IPMI_Version_Change_Firmware_Or_Software_Incompatibility_Detected_With_Associated_Entity

